************ JW: To raise error when Credit Stock field is initial  -- 23/06/2025 **********

IF salesdocument_extension-yy1_creditstock_sdh IS INITIAL.
  ls_message-messagetype = 'E'.
  ls_message-messagetext  = |Please fill the Credit Stock field|.
ENDIF.
